<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    2557   1593     179    43</p>
<p> Great Lakes    30313    349    4383    21</p>
<p> River Points   17557   4888   11927    23</p>
<p> Southwest	16955   5962     347    17</p>
<p> Gulf Points    21093   3849    1931    31</p>
<p> Plains Area    38085   7317    2028    20</p>
<p> Pacific NW     12673    628     unq    42</p>
<p> Grand Total   139233  24586   20795    23</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
